# One-tree plan, phase 3: GpuPresenter's frames on the fixture (index.html),
# beside p3_tree_fixture's.
#
# The same windows: from load in the first window, then after 600 frames
# to settle.
log phase 3: GpuPresenter on the fixture
timing start fixture-startup
settle 240
timing stop
wait 600
capture p3_presenter_fixture_startup
settle 600
timing start fixture-steady
settle 240
timing stop
wait 600
capture p3_presenter_fixture_steady
# The page lane ends as soon as its last step runs, so the final capture
# needs a wait to land before the report is written.
wait 30
